msgstr "曲线预设"

msgid "Requested duty"
msgstr "请求占空比"

msgid "Use a target at or below the protection threshold and a response interval of 15 °C up to the target."
msgstr "目标温度不得高于保护阈值，响应区间须在 15 °C 至目标温度之间。"

msgid "Target temperature (°C)"
msgstr "目标温度（°C）"

msgid "Response interval (°C)"
msgstr "响应区间（°C）"

msgid "Transition width (°C)"
msgstr "过渡宽度（°C）"

msgid "Apply target"
msgstr "应用目标"

msgid "Response starts at %s °C · Effective transition %s °C"
msgstr "从 %s °C 开始响应 · 有效过渡 %s °C"

msgid "Curve has unapplied changes."
msgstr "曲线有未应用的修改。"

msgid "Saved curve is invalid. Restore six default points to edit."
msgstr "已保存的曲线无效，请恢复六个默认点后编辑。"

msgid "Select Custom curve to edit the six curve points."
msgstr "选择「自定义曲线」后可编辑六个曲线点。"

msgid "%s · Point %s"
msgstr "%s · 第 %s 点"

msgid "Temperatures must increase and output must stay level or increase. Nonzero output must stay within the running limits."
msgstr "温度须递增，输出可持平或递增，非零输出须在运行范围内。"

msgid "Output (%)"
msgstr "输出（%）"

msgid "Restore curve defaults"
msgstr "恢复默认曲线"

msgid "Kernel control"
msgstr "内核控制"

msgid "Protection active"
msgstr "保护响应"

msgid "Not in control"
msgstr "未接管"

msgid "Temperature protection"
msgstr "温度保护"

msgid "Curve request"
msgstr "曲线请求"

msgid "Current temperature"
msgstr "当前温度"

msgid "Curve parameters"
msgstr "曲线参数"

msgid "Take over fan control"
msgstr "接管风扇控制"

msgid "Hardware verification is pending."
msgstr "等待实机接管验证。"

msgid "Protection ramps up before the threshold, locks at 100%, and releases below the threshold by the configured hysteresis."
msgstr "温度保护在阈值前逐步提高输出，到阈值锁定 100%，降至阈值减回差后解除。"

msgid "The protection threshold must be at or above the target."
msgstr "保护阈值不得低于目标温度。"

msgid "The early ramp window can reach at most 40 °C below the threshold."
msgstr "提前区间最多可覆盖阈值以下 40 °C。"

msgid "Early ramp window (°C)"
msgstr "提前区间（°C）"

msgid "Release hysteresis (°C)"
msgstr "解除回差（°C）"

msgid "Settings applied."
msgstr "已应用设置。"

msgid "Fixed request"
msgstr "固定请求"

msgid "Selected"
msgstr "已选"

msgid "Not selected"
msgstr "未选"

msgid "Target drive parameters"
msgstr "定温驱动参数"

msgid "Waiting for temperature readings"
msgstr "等待温度读数"

msgid "Live temperature readings"
msgstr "温度读数中"

msgid "Drives the fan from the plugin; not verified yet, so it stays off."
msgstr "由插件驱动风扇；尚未核验，暂不可启用。"

msgid "Drives the fan from the plugin; the kernel keeps throttling and the critical shutdown."
msgstr "由插件驱动风扇；内核仍负责降频与临界关机。"

msgid "Fan control"
msgstr "风扇控制"

msgid "Mode selection"
msgstr "模式选择"

msgid "Plugin control"
msgstr "插件控制"

msgid "Decrease duty"
msgstr "降低占空比"

msgid "Increase duty"
msgstr "提高占空比"

msgid "Pending"
msgstr "待应用"

msgid "Undo"
msgstr "撤销"

msgid "Applying in %s s"
msgstr "应用中 %s 秒"

msgid "Curve too low in the hot zone"
msgstr "高温区曲线过低"

msgid "Fan stopped"
msgstr "停转"

msgid "Excessive temperature may shorten the hardware life"
msgstr "温度过高可能影响设备硬件寿命"

msgid "Automatic theme"
msgstr "自动明暗"

msgid "Light theme"
msgstr "亮色"

msgid "Dark theme"
msgstr "暗色"

msgid "Switch to English"
msgstr "切换到英文"

msgid "Switch to Chinese"
msgstr "切换到中文"

msgid "Waiting for samples…"
msgstr "等待采样…"
msgid "Non-zero request floor"
msgstr "非零请求下限"

msgid "Non-zero request floor (%)"
msgstr "非零请求下限（%）"

msgid ""
"Except for an explicit 0% stop request, no request drives the fan below this "
"value. A higher floor keeps an aging or dusty fan turning at low duty."
msgstr ""
"除 0% 停转请求外，任何请求的输出都不会低于这个值。抬高下限可以让老化、积灰的风扇在低占空比下更容易维持转动。"

msgid "Curve output ceiling (%)"
msgstr "曲线输出上限（%）"

msgid "Startup boost output (%)"
msgstr "启动助推输出（%）"

msgid "All sensors (highest valid reading)"
msgstr "全部传感器（取最高有效值）"

msgid "no reading"
msgstr "无读数"

msgid "thermal zone"
msgstr "温区"

msgid "When a sensor reading is unusable or a PWM write fails, the controller asks for 100% output instead of guessing. This behaviour is fixed and has no switch; CPU throttling and the critical shutdown still belong to the kernel."
msgstr "传感器读数不可用或 PWM 写入失败时，控制器直接请求 100% 输出，不做猜测。该行为固定、不提供开关；CPU 降频与临界关机仍由内核负责。"

msgid "A reading counts as valid when the sensor file is readable and the value is within −40…150 °C; sensors without a valid reading are skipped. The fan curve above — the temperature-to-output curve, not the history chart — follows this sensor, or the highest valid one when “All sensors” is selected. Sensors outside the choice still count toward the safety maximum."
msgstr "传感器文件可读且数值在 −40…150 °C 内才算有效，无有效读数的传感器会被跳过。上方风扇曲线（温度到输出的那条曲线，不是温度监控图表）跟随所选传感器；选“全部传感器”时取其中最高有效值。未选中的传感器仍参与安全最高温仲裁。"

msgid "No request, protection ramp or startup boost drives the fan above this value. Lowering it caps high-speed noise, including the whine a small fan makes near full duty, at the cost of the highest speed protection can still reach; a fault still asks for a full 100%."
msgstr "任何请求、保护斜坡或启动助推都不会把风扇推到这个值以上。调低它可以压低高转速风噪，包括小风扇在接近满速时的啸叫；代价是保护能给出的最高转速也随之降低，故障时仍然按 100% 处理。"

msgid "Fan curve settings"
msgstr "风扇曲线设置"

msgid "How often the controller samples and which sensor feeds the fan curve."
msgstr "控制器多久采样一次，以及风扇曲线跟随哪个传感器。"

msgid "Monitor window (minutes)"
msgstr "监控窗口（分钟）"

msgid "How far back the temperature monitor chart reaches."
msgstr "温度监控图表向前覆盖的时间范围。"

msgid "Monitor interval (seconds)"
msgstr "监控间隔（秒）"

msgid "How often the monitor refreshes. The same interval paces the samples it records, so no refresh lands between two readings."
msgstr "监控多久刷新一次。同一间隔也决定记录样本的疏密，因此不会有某次刷新落在两次读数之间的空档。"

msgid "Temperature monitor settings"
msgstr "温度监控设置"

msgid "How the temperature monitor chart is drawn."
msgstr "温度监控图表如何绘制。"

msgid "Temperature history unavailable"
msgstr "温度历史读取失败"

msgid "All changes applied"
msgstr "所有更改已应用"

msgid "Applies automatically in %d s"
msgstr "%d 秒后自动应用"

msgid "Applying changes…"
msgstr "正在应用…"

msgid "Apply now"
msgstr "立即应用"

msgid "Time"
msgstr "时间"

msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "温度"

msgid "Fan curve data"
msgstr "风扇曲线数据"

msgid "Temperature monitor data"
msgstr "温度监控数据"

msgid "No unsaved changes"
msgstr "没有未保存的更改"

msgid "%d unsaved change(s)"
msgstr "%d 项未保存"

msgid "The non-zero request floor must not exceed the curve output ceiling."
msgstr "非零请求下限不能高于曲线输出上限。"

msgid "The curve output ceiling must not be below the non-zero request floor."
msgstr "曲线输出上限不能低于非零请求下限。"

msgid "Temperature reading expired"
msgstr "温度过期"
